msgstr "Storitev Nurevo ni nastavljena."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1904
msgid "The page text does not state your key facts, so AI has only your markup to go on."
msgstr "Besedilo strani ne navaja ključnih dejstev, zato se AI lahko opira le na oznake."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2678
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2747
msgid "The pairing code is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "Koda za povezovanje je neveljavna ali je potekla."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4139
msgid "The profile sync was rejected by the service."
msgstr "Storitev je zavrnila sinhronizacijo profila."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1886
msgid "The raw HTML carries neither your content nor your schema, so crawlers that skip JavaScript see an empty page."
msgstr "Surovi HTML ne vsebuje ne vaše vsebine ne schema, zato pajki, ki ne izvajajo JavaScripta, vidijo prazno stran."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4829
msgid "The service could not diagnose this site. This usually means it is not reachable from the internet yet - a local or password-protected site cannot be read."
msgstr "Storitev tega spletnega mesta ni mogla diagnosticirati. Običajno to pomeni, da še ni dosegljivo z interneta – lokalnega ali z geslom zaščitenega spletnega mesta ni mogoče prebrati."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3394
msgid "The site key is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and configure it."
msgstr "Ključ spletnega mesta ni nastavljen. Odprite WebMCP > Nastavitve in ga nastavite."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3494
msgid "The site key is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and issue or paste a site key."
msgstr "Ključ spletnega mesta ni nastavljen. Odprite WebMCP > Nastavitve in izdajte ali prilepite ključ spletnega mesta."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3231
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3398
msgid "The tag.js URL is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and configure it."
msgstr "URL tag.js ni nastavljen. Odprite WebMCP > Nastavitve in ga nastavite."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3491
msgid "The tag.js URL is not configured. Open WebMCP > Settings and enter the public tag.js URL."
msgstr "URL tag.js ni nastavljen. Odprite WebMCP > Nastavitve in vnesite javni URL tag.js."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4534
msgid "The trend appears once a second measurement has run."
msgstr "Trend se prikaže po drugi meritvi."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3501
msgid "The WebMCP server did not respond within %d seconds. The URL may be unreachable from WordPress, the Worker may be slow, or Docker/network egress may be blocked."
