msgstr "Strežnik WebMCP je vrnil neveljaven JSON."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3370
msgid "There is no site key to disable."
msgstr "Ni ključa spletnega mesta, ki bi ga lahko onemogočili."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3348
msgid "There is no site key to regenerate."
msgstr "Ni ključa spletnega mesta, ki bi ga lahko obnovili."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1166
msgid "These collect content to train AI models. They are not needed to appear in AI answers, so this is your choice."
msgstr "Zbirajo vsebino za učenje modelov AI. Za prikaz v odgovorih AI niso potrebni, zato je izbira vaša."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1148
msgid "These fetch your pages to answer and cite them. Your existing robots.txt rules, such as /wp-admin/, keep applying to them."
msgstr "Pridobivajo vaše strani, da lahko odgovarjajo in jih citirajo. Vaša obstoječa pravila v robots.txt, kot je /wp-admin/, zanje še naprej veljajo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4814
msgid "These were inferred from your existing settings and published content. Only blank fields were filled, so please check that the values are right."
msgstr "Te vrednosti so bile izpeljane iz obstoječih nastavitev in objavljene vsebine. Izpolnjena so bila le prazna polja, zato preverite, ali so vrednosti pravilne."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2733
msgid "This code belongs to a site registered as %s. Pair it from that site, or correct the site address on the dashboard."
msgstr "Ta koda pripada spletnemu mestu, registriranemu kot %s. Povežite ga s tistega spletnega mesta ali popravite naslov spletnega mesta na nadzorni plošči."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4566
msgid "This is a beta feature. AI answers vary from run to run, so judge by the trend rather than any single result."
msgstr "To je funkcija beta. Odgovori AI se med zagoni razlikujejo, zato presojajte po trendu in ne po posameznem rezultatu."

